    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1059">

                <pb facs="0796" n="720" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg720"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.512/1187</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Special Representative Rodgers to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mexico City</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-05-07T12:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 7, 1916, noon</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>46. Department’s 70, May 6, 6 p.m. Mining law effective May 1, practically same
                    as that transmitted with mail despatch 25. Minor modifications only.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rodgers</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
